      <div class="card"><div class="step-num">2</div><h3>Massage</h3><p>Gently massage in with your fingertips.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="step-num">3</div><h3>Settle</h3><p>Reapply as needed to help your baby relax and settle.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

